Package: metabocli
Title: Command-Line Interface for MetaboAnalystR Statistical and Pathway Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("drclocli", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "torreschloe64@gmail.com")
Description: Runs two MetaboAnalyst modules locally through the MetaboAnalystR
    package: "Statistical Analysis [one factor]" and targeted "Pathway Analysis".
    Each run writes its plots, result tables and a machine-readable summary.json
    into a timestamped output directory. The run_*() functions can be called
    directly from R; the `metabo` executable wraps them in a CLI.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.0)
Imports:
    MetaboAnalystR,
    optparse,
    jsonlite,
    grDevices,
    stats,
    utils
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    pkgload
Remotes:
    xia-lab/MetaboAnalystR
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
